+/*
+ * The attention enable register and the value written to it, both
+ * parameters because the two vendor drivers carry one register map each and
+ * this controller takes the reset from one and the attention enable from the
+ * other.  Keeping them adjustable makes the pair testable from the command
+ * line on a panel whose generation is not known in advance: 0x1c / 0x41 is
+ * what works here, 0x2c / 0x48 is the STM_VER7 pair.
+ */
